gres_purchases\n  data_ref: event_purchase\n- from_id: process_router\n  to_id: sink_postgres_refunds\n  data_ref: event_refund\n- from_id: process_router\n  to_id: sink_kafka_unknown\n  data_ref: event_unknown",
